note A press on a node's header grabs the node, and defers selecting it with Built::select: SelectStep for a step of the drawn tour, Focus for any other node. Steer(Steering::Click) makes the next focus change keep the camera and the graph's root, so that selection neither re-centres the camera on the node being dragged nor re-roots the tree.
